      "id": "NW-0126",
      "title": "Sta. Cruz Day Care Overhaul Marks New Milestone for CSTEP Initiative",
      "date": "2026-01-27",
      "img-src": [
        {
          "url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dxnpxkapb/image/upload/v1771383615/622827145_1345120034321278_79344_wydrbw.png",
          "caption": ""
        },
        {
          "url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dxnpxkapb/image/upload/v1771383615/622880545_1345119934321288_39192_ypk5el.png",
          "caption": ""
        },
        {
          "url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dxnpxkapb/image/upload/v1771383615/622871972_1345120014321280_56716_x6swe1.png",
          "caption": ""
        }
      ],
      "desc": "<span class='font-sans font-medium text-gray-900 uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mr-3'>Panabo City —</span><p class='mb-8 text-lg leading-loose'>The Barangay Sta. Cruz Day Care Center has undergone a significant transformation through the Community Skills Training and Livelihood Entrepreneurship Program (CSTEP). This project serves as a cornerstone of the city's effort to deliver better facilities for children while providing local workers with tangible industry experience.\n  </p>\n\n  \n  <h2 class='text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mt-12 mb-4 font-sans font-medium'>Infrastructure Evolution</h2>\n  <div class='w-12 h-[1px] bg-gray-300 mb-6'></div>\n  <p class='mb-8 text-lg leading-loose'>\n    The renovation highlights high-impact improvements designed for long-term utility. Key upgrades include the installation of new tiled flooring and a fully functional, hygienic kitchen suitable for daily use and school nutritional programs.\n  </p>\n\n  \n  <h2 class='text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mt-12 mb-4 font-sans font-medium'>A Unique Training Model</h2>\n  <div class='w-12 h-[1px] bg-gray-300 mb-6'></div>\n  <p class='mb-8 text-lg leading-loose'>\n    Unlike traditional construction projects, this overhaul served as a live training site. CSTEP participants applied their classroom theories to actual construction as part of their On-the-Job Training (OJT), ensuring that the project benefits the community twice: once through the facility, and again through local job creation.\n  </p>\n\n  \n  <h2 class='text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em]  mt-12 mb-4 font-sans font-medium'>Future Roadmap</h2>\n  <div class='w-12 h-[1px] bg-gray-300 mb-6'></div>\n  <p class='mb-16 text-lg leading-loose'>\n    Coordinated by Councilor Relampagos alongside the City Mayor’s Office and CPESO, the success in Brgy. Sta. Cruz signals the start of a broader rollout. Program officials have confirmed that after the successful completion in Brgy. Buenavista and Sta. Cruz, the initiative will move next to Barangay Mabunao. </p>",
      "author": "City Information Office",
      "tags": ["Education"],
      "sources": "https://panabocity.gov.ph/day-care-center-in-barangay-sta-cruz-renovated-through-cstep-program/"
    },
